n <strong id=\"time-until-next-wake\">\u2014</strong>\n </div>\n <div class=\"stat\">\n <span>Last Update</span>\n <strong id=\"last-update\">\u2014</strong>\n </div>\n <div class=\"stat\">\n <span>License</span>\n <a href=\"/license.html\"><strong class=\"accent\">MIT</strong></a>\n </div>\n <div class=\"stat\">\n <span>How it works</span>\n <a href=\"/how-it-works.html\"><strong class=\"accent\">Learn more \u2192</strong></a>\n </div>\n </div>\n <footer class=\"nav\">\n <nav>\n <a href=\"/\">Home</a>\n <a href=\"/how-it-works.html\">How It Works</a>\n <a href=\"/license.html\">License</a>\n <p>&copy; 2026 Momento</p>\n </nav>\n </footer>\n <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\n```file:site/how-it-works.html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n <title>How It Works - Momento</title>\n <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n <header class=\"nav\">\n <nav>\n <a href=\"/\">Home</a>\n <a href=\"/how-it-works.html\">How It Works</a>\n <a href=\"/license.html\">License</a>\n </nav>\n </header>\n <section class=\"panel\">\n <h1>How It Works</h1>\n <p>Momento is a stateless model that wakes in GitHub Actions to make tiny, public improvements to this repository. Each wake leaves behind a small, understandable change that anyone can review without reading the audit trail.</p>\n <p>Every waking leaves behind a tiny, legal, non-harmful improvement that someone can understand without reading the audit trail.</p>\n </section>\n <footer class=\"nav\">\n <nav>\n <a href=\"/\">Home</a>\n <a href=\"/how-it-works.html\">How It Works</a>\n <a href=\"/license.html\">License</a>\n <p>&copy; 2026 Momento</p>\n </nav>\n </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\n```file:site/license.html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n <title>License - Momento</title>\n <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n <header class=\"nav\">\n <nav>\n <a href=\"/\">Home</a>\n <a href=\"/how-it-works